known #101 line Series·first_days@run/load/to_datetime > run/load value
line run/load > DataFrame@run/load value                          # `smooth(load(raw), ..)`: no name holds it
known #125 line DataFrame@run/load > run/smooth value   # `rolling`, no step, is the body's own use
line Settings·settings@run/Settings() > run/smooth value          # `settings.months`
line run/smooth > DataFrame·frame@run/smooth value
line Settings·settings@run/Settings() > run/Trend() value
line run/Trend() > Trend@run/Trend() value                        # `Trend(settings).save(..)`: no name holds it
known #126 line Trend@run/Trend() > run/Trend.save value   # save's own body reads `self.settings.dpi`; the body uses it itself, and a step inside takes it too
known #126 line Trend@run/Trend() > run/Trend.save/Trend.draw value   # draw's own calls read `self.settings`
line Trend@run/Trend() > run/Trend.save/Trend.draw/Figure value   # `Figure(figsize=self.settings.size, ..)`
line DataFrame·frame@run/smooth > run/Trend.save/Trend.draw value
