known #101 line Axes·ax@run/Trend.save/Trend.draw/add_subplot > run/Trend.save/Trend.draw value  # `ax.plot(..)`, ..
known #101 line Figure·figure@run/Trend.save/Trend.draw/Figure > run/Trend.save/Trend.draw value  # `return figure`
